## 10  Complete file checklist

Work through this in order. Every item is mandatory.

- [ ] **`RuleType`** — new enum entry (one per family: `DURATION_BASED_*` and `RANGE_BASED_*`)
- [ ] **Rule class** — `rules/hourly/MyNewRule.java` (duration-based family)
- [ ] **Rule class** — `rules/shifts/MyNewRule.java` (range-based family)
- [ ] **Resolver** — `rules/timerange_resolver/duration_based/DurationBasedMyNewRuleTimeRangeResolver.java`
- [ ] **Resolver** — `rules/timerange_resolver/range_based/RangeBasedMyNewRuleTimeRangeResolver.java`
- [ ] **`RuleFactory.createRule()`** — two `case` branches
- [ ] **`RuleFactory.initializeTimeRangeResolverMap()`** — two `map.put(...)` entries
- [ ] **`RulePrecedenceConfig`** — insert at correct position in both precedence lists
- [ ] **Tests** — rule class tests for both families (6 scenarios minimum each)
- [ ] **Tests** — resolver tests for both families
- [ ] **Tests** — two new tests in `RuleFactoryTests`

